 Active Directory Configuration

This section documents the creation and configuration of the Active Directory domain.

Configuration
- Installed Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS).
- Promoted DC01 to a domain controller.
- Created the adlab.test domain.
- Configured domain and DNS services.
- Created departmental organisational units.
- Created domain user accounts.
- Created departmental security groups.
- Added users to their respective groups.

